# Scene1-2-18

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐2-18
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:此刻，所有少女都集合在会客厅。<br>没有人敢违反规定。|#0102Adv18_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家的眼神都晦暗无光。|#0102Adv18_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到米莉亚遇害的消息，<br>没有亲眼看到现场的玛格和亚里沙<br>也摆出了不愿面对现实的表情。|#0102Adv18_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:听说米莉亚遇害了，<br>是真的吗……？|#0102Adv18_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是真的，我们亲眼看到了。|#0102Adv18_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能明显看出是他杀吗？|#0102Adv18_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:应该，是这样的……<br>她被绑着不能动，而且如果不是他杀的话，<br>尸体情况也不至于……|#0102Adv18_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格忧郁地叹了口气。|#0102Adv18_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……那就意味着，<br>要举行魔女审判了。|#0102Adv18_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:搞什么审判啊真没劲。|#0102Adv18_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算那个大叔被杀了<br>又怎么样？反正她背叛了我们。|#0102Adv18_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:闭嘴吧臭女人。|#0102Adv18_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:嘴上装着不饶人，其实就是小太妹你干的吧～？<br>热气球被毁掉你超级生气的吧？|#0102Adv18_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再说我就真把你烧了。|#0102Adv18_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:要说热气球被毁掉的怨恨，大家应该都有吧。<br>哎呀，那就是说<br>所有人都有杀害米莉亚的动机吗？|#0102Adv18_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我才不会因为这点事情杀人！|#0102Adv18_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即将转变为魔女的人会被杀意迷惑，<br>这谁说得清楚呢。|#0102Adv18_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（气氛变得剑拔弩张起来了……<br>　这也难怪，因为有人杀了米莉亚）|#0102Adv18_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（再不找出凶手，<br>　我们也要被处刑）|#0102Adv18_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大家都在互相怀疑，<br>　猜测谁是凶手）|#0102Adv18_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛好不容易搭建起来的友情和信任<br>眼看着就要轻易地崩塌了。|#0102Adv18_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，随着天花板边上传来一阵翅膀拍动的声音，<br>典狱长现身了。|#0102Adv18_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……凶杀案……<br>还是发生了……而且还是在大晚上……|#0102Adv18_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:建议你们尽快开始搜查吧。<br>这次是特殊处理，<br>会在今晚0点举行【魔女审判】。|#0102Adv18_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:哈！？那不是只剩一个半小时了！<br>你在搞笑吗！？|#0102Adv18_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:你有意见归有意见……<br>可我也是在加班啊。<br>再晚我就等不了了……|#0102Adv18_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位务必从在场的囚犯之中锁定杀人凶手的身份。<br>选中的人将以【魔女】的身份被处以死刑……<br>还有就是老规矩，如果无法锁定凶手，所有人都要接受处刑。|#0102Adv18_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然现在是禁止外出时间，但搜查期间允许自由出入。<br>那么，请各位努力找出凶手吧。|#0102Adv18_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，等下……！|#0102Adv18_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长自顾自把话说完<br>就飞走了。|#0102Adv18_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而一众少女则不知所措地愣在原地。|#0102Adv18_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（一小时内查明杀害米莉亚的凶手……？）|#0102Adv18_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么可能做得到！）|#0102Adv18_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……现在唯一确定的是，<br>米莉亚不是幕后黑手对吧。|#0102Adv18_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之前因为她扰乱了越狱计划，<br>我们就以为她真的是幕后黑手。|#0102Adv18_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的……可这样一来，就越来越搞不懂<br>米莉亚捣乱的原因了……|#0102Adv18_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总、总之快行动起来吧。<br>我们得好好搜查，找到杀害米莉亚的凶手。|#0102Adv18_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛刚准备跑去门口的时候。|#0102Adv18_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格挡在艾玛身前，把她拦住。|#0102Adv18_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，你怎么了……|#0102Adv18_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我有个提议，可以听一下吗。|#0102Adv18_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格打断了艾玛的话，她的声音从未如此铿锵有力。|#0102Adv18_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，<br>你打算和雪莉她们一起搜查对吧？|#0102Adv18_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯，是这样没错。|#0102Adv18_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不自觉地依次看向雪莉、汉娜和梅露露。<br>她们都点了点头。|#0102Adv18_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Angry1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:可以不要这样做吗？|#0102Adv18_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，为什么……|#0102Adv18_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你们结盟的话，<br>会对你们团队以外的人来说<br>非常不利。|#0102Adv18_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉“啪”的一声拍了下手。|#0102Adv18_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道了，操控投票！如果我们事先商量好的话，<br>就能够把特定人票选为凶手！|#0102Adv18_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，你脑袋转得还挺快的，我想说的就是这么一回事。|#0102Adv18_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你竟然认为我们会做那种卑鄙无耻之事！？|#0102Adv18_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:我也不愿意这么想……<br>但你们团队外的人<br>肯定会很害怕吧？|#0102Adv18_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，为了公平起见，<br>希望你们不要一起搜查，而是分开搜查。|#0102Adv18_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请你们不要再结盟了，<br>好吗，艾玛。你明白我的意思吧？|#0102Adv18_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在玛格压迫感十足的发言下，<br>艾玛难过地皱起眉。|#0102Adv18_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然玛格说得并没有错……<br>　可是……到头来她还是谁也不相信啊）|#0102Adv18_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:知道了……我们分开搜查吧。|#0102Adv18_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，把得到的情报分享出去应该没关系吧？|#0102Adv18_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:那当然，毕竟最重要的是查明凶手。<br>一起加油吧，艾玛。|#0102Adv18_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格莞尔一笑，<br>而艾玛却不敢直视她的脸。|#0102Adv18_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着艾玛等人离开会客厅，<br>开始各自搜查。|#0102Adv18_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SetCustomVariable Expression:"chosenAreaFlag = 0"
